      "output": "`REQUIREMENTS.md` has been written to the project root. Here's a summary of what was produced:\n\n---\n\n**REQUIREMENTS.md — Change Theme to Light**\n\n**Context analyzed:**\n- `packages/ui/src/theme/spaceTheme.ts` — uses `theme.darkAlgorithm` with dark tokens (`#0A0A0F`, `#14141F`, etc.)\n- 8 component CSS modules with hardcoded dark colors across Navbar, Hero, CtaBanner, FeatureCard, Footer, SectionWrapper, ContactForm, MissionStrip\n\n**Key requirements captured:**\n\n| Section | Highlights |\n|---|---|\n| **Scope** | 9 features (F1–F9) covering the Ant Design token config + all CSS modules; accent color `#4F8EF7` preserved |\n| **Functional** | 6 user stories (light page, navbar, hero, cards, CTA banner, footer) with Given/When/Then ACs |\n| **Business Rules** | WCAG AA contrast enforced; `defaultAlgorithm` required; specific dark hex values must be absent post-implementation |\n| **Data** | Color mapping table: current dark → target light for every affected CSS property |\n| **Testing** | 4 unit checks, 1 integration check, 5 E2E scenarios including full regression suite |\n| **Open Questions** | 5 questions flagged (permanent vs. toggle, color palette source, hero gradient style, MissionStrip review, Ant Design component overrides) |",
